   "body": "v.1's four ὃ-clauses are a fronted object with no verb; v.2 is a parenthesis (it does contain ἀπαγγέλλομεν); the sentence resolves only at v.3, ἀπαγγέλλομεν καὶ ὑμῖν. In discourse grammar such fronting is marked — the backlog you carry is the point (Runge)."
